OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAreas of cloud will affect
OL,6,Fnorthern and western areas on
OL,7,FWednesday, thick enough at first to
OL,8,Fgive patchy drizzle and some fog over
OL,9,Fthe hills. The southeast will see the
OL,10,Fbest of the sunshine, and turning very
OL,11,Fwarm here.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSome sunshine to end the day
OL,14,Fin the east, though cloudier further
OL,15,Fwest, and cloud generally feeding
OL,16,Facross the country from the northwest
OL,17,Fovernight. Some patchy drizzle
OL,18,Fdeveloping again.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
