OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FThursday will start rather
OL,6,Fcloudy with the odd spot of rain.
OL,7,FSkies will brighten from the northwest
OL,8,Fleaving a mostly fine afternoon.
OL,9,FFeeling much fresher in gentle
OL,10,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday
OL,13,Fand the weekend will hold onto a
OL,14,Ffresher feel. There will be a lot of
OL,15,Fdry weather with some sunny spells,
OL,16,Fthough isolated showers are also
OL,17,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
